direction: right
Web: Web application {shape: page}
Orders: Order service {shape: rectangle}
Bus: Event bus {shape: queue}
Inventory: Inventory consumer {shape: rectangle}
Billing: Billing consumer {shape: rectangle}
Shipping: Shipping consumer {shape: rectangle}
Notifications: Notification consumer {shape: rectangle}
InventoryDB: Inventory database {shape: cylinder}
Ledger: Billing ledger {shape: cylinder}
Web -> Orders
Orders -> Bus: OrderCreated
Bus -> Inventory
Bus -> Billing
Bus -> Shipping
Bus -> Notifications
Inventory -> InventoryDB
Billing -> Ledger
